# T109: pre-recorded harness fixtures. Generated on demand via
# harness/latency/record-y4m.sh, NOT checked in.
#
# 30s @ 720p I420 ≈ 150 MiB; 30s @ 1080p ≈ 320 MiB. Either pushes
# us into git-lfs territory and changes our binary-asset story
# without enough payoff for "this re-renders deterministically
# from the page". Operators run record-y4m.sh once per dev box.

*.y4m
*.yuv
